*.md      text
*.toml    text
*.po      text
*.pot     text
*.lsp     text

# Original game data: binary, never converted (AGENTS.md rule 1).
*.spe     binary
*.wad     binary
*.pcx     binary
*.png     binary

# No Git LFS here, on purpose.
#
# This repository is a public fork, and GitHub refuses new LFS objects on one:
# the storage is billed to the parent repository, so a fork can never upload.
# The reference frames are 9 BMP files of 65 KB, which git stores perfectly
# well on its own.
#
# When the free audio pack arrives it will hit the same wall. The choice then
# is to keep the files small enough for plain git, or to detach the fork on
# GitHub so it stops being one.
data/hd/**            binary
data/sfx-free/**      binary
data/music-free/**    binary
*.ogg     binary
*.flac    binary
*.wav     binary
*.bmp     binary
*.hex     text
